  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Yu Bo is a Wu clan Gu Immortal and a prideful person whose peak rank seven battle strength is only slightly lower than Old Treeman Ba De’s. Immortal Yan Huang challenges him with Moon Bowl as the stake after joining Xia clan, and Wu Yong sends Fang Yuan along as guard. Wu Yu Bo earlier defeated Immortal Yan Huang when Wu clan took Moon Bowl, then defeated him again after Yan Huang sought revenge.",
      "chapters": [
        1303
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_ba_de",
        "char_yan_huang",
        "loc_moon_bowl",
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a tall body, wears a black and white coat, and has a long beard that extends down to his chest. His eyes are slim and long with a mysterious light, and his body is covered in mist.",
      "chapters": [
        1303
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He cultivates water path. In the duel he moves like falling leaves, covers himself in water vapor, and dissolves Immortal Yan Huang’s flames and rocks with drizzle, holding the upper hand until Yan Huang breaks his signature killer move and traps him in a lava battlefield killer move. The break catches him off-guard and injures him heavily at once, and he is pale and in grave danger inside the battlefield. Fang Yuan breaks that battlefield as a divination tortoise and saves him. Xia clan then claims Moon Bowl, and Xia Qing Cang stops Immortal Yan Huang from killing him.",
      "chapters": [
        1303
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "moon-bowl-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia clan spreads news of the loss. Wu Yu Bo returns ashamed, declares secluded cultivation, and later sends a will that gifts Fang Yuan rank six vajra thought Immortal Gu in thanks for saving his life.",
      "chapters": [
        1304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aftermath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_vajra_thought_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Within Wu clan he is the strongest rank seven Gu Immortal, with only the rank eight Wu Yong above him. Xia clan’s rank seven Xia Fei Kuai is only slightly weaker than him. While Wu Yu Bo stays in secluded cultivation, Xia Fei Kuai judges nobody is left in Wu clan for him to fear. In real battle strength Immortal Yan Huang is no match for Wu Yu Bo, and Xia clan won that fight instead by cracking his signature killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1309
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-among-wu-clans-gu-immortals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_xia_fei_kuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reflecting after his own spar with Xia clan, Fang Yuan likens it to Immortal Yan Huang’s win over Wu Yu Bo: both wins came down to better intelligence rather than raw strength, since Wu Yu Bo was powerful but had his trump card killer move seen through, and one careless move then cost him everything.",
      "chapters": [
        1312
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeat-traced-to-intelligence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mountain Moving Old Monster, a lone cultivator who has lived for over two thousand years, is a famous expert among lone immortals whose battle strength is almost at the level of Old Treeman Ba De and Wu Yu Bo.",
      "chapters": [
        1315
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mountain-moving-old-monsters-estimate",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mountain_moving_old_monster"
      ]
    }
  ],
